sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant C as Client
  participant A as API
  participant S as Sources
  participant E as Entitlements (CSV + XML)
  participant U as Usage warehouse
  participant D as platform.db

  C->>A: GET /v1/customers/ACC-007 + bearer token
  A->>A: Correlation ID, validate JWT, rate limit, check scope
  par Entitlements, 1.2 s budget
    A->>S: loadEntitlements()
    alt Cache younger than 60 s
      S-->>A: Cached view
    else Expired: one refresh, everyone waiting shares it
      S->>E: Fetch CSV and XML, separate breakers
      alt Both healthy and not empty
        E-->>S: Rows
        S->>D: Replace snapshot
        S-->>A: Fresh view
      else Failed, bad or empty data
        S->>D: Load snapshot
        S-->>A: Snapshot with asOf and reason, or failure if none
      end
    end
  and Usage, 0.5 s budget
    A->>U: Latest month for this account
    U-->>A: Usage, or failure recorded as a reason
  end
  alt No entitlement data at all
    A-->>C: 503 problem+json
  else Entitlements available
    A->>A: Withhold ARR without the financials scope, listed in redactedFields
    A-->>C: 200, with degraded and degradedSources. Cache-Control is private, or no-store if degraded
  end
